          <VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>For completeness of forensic analysis, it is necessary to track who/what (a user or other principal) logs on to the DBMS.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
